{"text":"kuruntokai","n":27,"lines":["கன்று முண்ணாது கலத்தினும் படாது","நல்லான் தீம்பால் நிலத்துக் காஅங்","கெனக்கு மாகா தென்னைக்கு முதவாது","பசலை உணீஇயர் வேண்டும்","திதலை அல்குலென் மாமைக் கவினே"],"tr":["kaṉṟu muṇṇātu kalattiṉum paṭātu","nallāṉ tīmpāl nilattuk kāaṅ","keṉakku mākā teṉṉaikku mutavātu","pacalai uṇīiyar vēṇṭum","titalai alkuleṉ māmaik kaviṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"வெள்ளிவீதியார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Veḷḷivītiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 16, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 8, veṇṭaḷai 7, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கன்று","tr":"kaṉṟu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கன்","tr":"kaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"முண்ணாது","tr":"muṇṇātu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முண்","tr":"muṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணா","tr":"ṇā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"கலத்தினும்","tr":"kalattiṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலத்","tr":"kalat"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தினும்","tr":"tiṉum"}]},{"text":"படாது","tr":"paṭātu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படா","tr":"paṭā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"நல்லான்","tr":"nallāṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லான்","tr":"lāṉ"}]},{"text":"தீம்பால்","tr":"tīmpāl","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தீம்","tr":"tīm"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பால்","tr":"pāl"}]},{"text":"நிலத்துக்","tr":"nilattuk","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிலத்","tr":"nilat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"துக்","tr":"tuk"}]},{"text":"காஅங்","tr":"kāaṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அங்","tr":"aṅ"}]}],[{"text":"கெனக்கு","tr":"keṉakku","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கெனக்","tr":"keṉak"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]},{"text":"மாகா","tr":"mākā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"}]},{"text":"தென்னைக்கு","tr":"teṉṉaikku","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தென்","tr":"teṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னைக்","tr":"ṉaik"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]},{"text":"முதவாது","tr":"mutavātu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முத","tr":"muta"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"பசலை","tr":"pacalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பச","tr":"paca"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"உணீஇயர்","tr":"uṇīiyar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உணீ","tr":"uṇī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இயர்","tr":"iyar"}]},{"text":"வேண்டும்","tr":"vēṇṭum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேண்","tr":"vēṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டும்","tr":"ṭum"}]}],[{"text":"திதலை","tr":"titalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தித","tr":"tita"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"அல்குலென்","tr":"alkuleṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அல்","tr":"al"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குலென்","tr":"kuleṉ"}]},{"text":"மாமைக்","tr":"māmaik","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மைக்","tr":"maik"}]},{"text":"கவினே","tr":"kaviṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவி","tr":"kavi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"கன்றும்","lemma":"கன்று","gloss":"calf also"}],"gloss":"calf also"},{"surface":"உண்ணாது","parts":[{"text":"உண்ணாது","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"without drinking"}],"gloss":"without drinking"},{"surface":"கலத்தினும்","parts":[{"text":"கலத்தினும்","lemma":"கலம்","gloss":"in the vessel also"}],"gloss":"in the vessel also"},{"surface":"படாது","parts":[{"text":"படாது","lemma":"படு","gloss":"without being poured"}],"gloss":"without being poured"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்லான்","parts":[{"text":"நல்லான்","lemma":"நல்லான்","gloss":"good cow"}],"gloss":"good cow"},{"surface":"தீம்பால்","parts":[{"text":"தீம்பால்","lemma":"தீம்பால்","gloss":"sweet milk"}],"gloss":"sweet milk"},{"surface":"நிலத்து","parts":[{"text":"நிலத்து","lemma":"நிலம்","gloss":"ground"}],"gloss":"on the ground"},{"surface":"உக்காஅங்","parts":[{"text":"உக்காஅங்","lemma":"உகு","gloss":"spilled"}],"gloss":"spilled"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கெனக்கு","parts":[{"text":"கெனக்கு","lemma":"எனக்கும்","gloss":"to me also"}],"gloss":"to me also"},{"surface":"மாகா","parts":[{"text":"மாகா","lemma":"ஆகாது","gloss":"of no use"}],"gloss":"of no use"},{"surface":"தென்னைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தென்னைக்கு","lemma":"என்னைக்கும்","gloss":"to my lord also"}],"gloss":"to my lord also"},{"surface":"முதவாது","parts":[{"text":"முதவாது","lemma":"உதவாது","gloss":"of no use"}],"gloss":"of no use"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பசலை","parts":[{"text":"பசலை","lemma":"பசலை","gloss":"pallor"}],"gloss":"pallor"},{"surface":"உணீஇயர்","parts":[{"text":"உணீஇயர்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"to consume"}],"gloss":"to consume"},{"surface":"வேண்டும்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டும்","lemma":"வேண்டு","gloss":"wants"}],"gloss":"wants"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திதலை","parts":[{"text":"திதலை","lemma":"திதலை","gloss":"beauty spots"}],"gloss":"beauty spots"},{"surface":"அல்குல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்குல்","lemma":"அல்குல்","gloss":"waist"}],"gloss":"waist"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"மாமை","parts":[{"text":"மாமை","lemma":"மாமை","gloss":"dark beauty"}],"gloss":"dark beauty"},{"surface":"கவினே","parts":[{"text":"கவினே","lemma":"கவின்","gloss":"beauty indeed"}],"gloss":"beauty indeed"}]}],"literal":"Even the calf not drinking, and not being poured into a vessel, / the sweet milk of a good cow spilling on the ground, / of no use to me, and of no help to my lord, / pallor wants to consume / the dark beauty of my waist adorned with beauty spots.","translation":"Like the sweet milk of a good cow, which is neither drunk by its calf nor collected in a vessel but is spilled wasted on the ground, the dark beauty of my waist adorned with beauty spots is of no use to me, nor does it help my lord; instead, pallor desires to consume it.","modern":"கன்றும் குடிக்காமல், பாத்திரத்திலும் சேகரிக்கப்படாமல், நல்ல பசுவின் இனிமையான பால் தரையில் கொட்டி வீணாவது போல, அழகுத் தேமல்கள் கொண்ட என் அல்குலின் மாமை நிற அழகு எனக்கும் பயன்படாமல், என் தலைவனுக்கும் உதவாமல், பசலை நோய் தின்று தீர்க்க விரும்புகிறது.","explanation":"This poem is set in the pālai (wasteland/separation) landscape, spoken by the heroine to herself or her confidante in deep grief. She laments her husband's absence, which has caused her physical beauty to fade as she is consumed by pacalai (the sallow pallor of separation). She compares her fading beauty to the sweet milk of a good cow that is wasted—neither nourishing the calf nor collected in a vessel for others, but simply spilled on the ground. Similarly, her youthful, dark beauty (māmai kaviṉ) is of no use to herself in her loneliness, nor does it bring joy to her husband (eṉṉai) who is far away. The poignant image of wasted milk perfectly captures the tragic waste of her youth and beauty during their separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,3.2],[3.2,3.3],[3.3,4.1],[4.1,4.31],[4.31,5.38],[5.38,5.98],[5.98,6.43],[6.43,6.8],[6.8,8.6],[8.6,8.8],[8.8,9.1],[9.1,10.6],[10.6,11.2],[11.2,11.3],[11.3,11.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.57],[0.57,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.7],[1.7,3.5],[3.5,3.7],[3.7,4.67],[4.67,4.76],[4.76,6.0],[6.0,6.64],[6.64,7.17],[7.17,7.5],[7.5,9.4],[9.4,9.7],[9.7,10.0],[10.0,11.6],[11.6,12.3],[12.3,12.4],[12.4,12.8]]}}